<title>UK: DSL unit sets 250 million guilder bond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit sets 250 million guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK  AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.515   PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
